Package: puron
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: elalonde <eric@lalonde.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: sensor readings in the COSMIC panel
 Puron is a COSMIC panel applet that shows temperatures, fan speeds and
 voltages from lm-sensors, NVMe and SATA drive temperatures, NVIDIA GPU
 temperatures and liquidctl devices, with a separate settings window.
